<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no">
    <title>เปิดถอดรหัสรอยอักษรสุโขทัย - Educational AR Game</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kanit:wght@400;600;800&family=Sarabun:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@mediapipe/camera_utils/camera_utils.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@mediapipe/drawing_utils/drawing_utils.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@mediapipe/hands/hands.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>

    <style>
        * {
            user-select: none;
            -webkit-user-select: none;
            touch-action: manipulation;
            font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif;
        }
        body, html {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            overflow: hidden;
            background-color: #0d1117;
        }
        .thai-serif {
            font-family: 'Sarabun', sans-serif;
        }
        /* Glassmorphism Classes */
        .glass-panel {
            background: rgba(22, 27, 34, 0.75);
            backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.3);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.37);
        }
        .glass-btn {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.8), rgba(180, 83, 9, 0.9));
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.2s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
        }
        .glass-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.6);
        }
        .glass-btn:active {
            transform: translateY(1px) scale(0.98);
        }
        /* Animations */
        @keyframes pulseSlow {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 0.9; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.05); opacity: 1; }
        }
        .animate-pulse-slow {
            animation: pulseSlow 3s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        @keyframes stoneFloat {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0px) rotate(0deg); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-8px) rotate(0.5deg); }
        }
        .stone-float {
            animation: stoneFloat 4s infinite ease-in-out;
        }
        /* Hidden Camera Element */
        #webcam {
            display: none;
        }
        /* Screen shake effect */
        .shake {
            animation: shake 0.5s cubic-bezier(.36,.07,.19,.97) both;
        }
        @keyframes shake {
            10%, 90% { transform: translate3d(-2px, 0, 0); }
            20%, 80% { transform: translate3d(4px, 0, 0); }
            30%, 50%, 70% { transform: translate3d(-6px, 0, 0); }
            40%, 60% { transform: translate3d(6px, 0, 0); }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="text-amber-50">

    <video id="webcam" playsinline></video>

    <div id="game-container" class="relative w-full h-full overflow-hidden flex flex-col justify-between">
        
        <canvas id="gameCanvas" class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full z-0"></canvas>

        <header id="hud" class="relative z-10 w-full p-2 sm:p-4 flex flex-wrap justify-between items-center glass-panel border-b border-amber-500/30 transition-all duration-300">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 sm:space-x-3">
                <span class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl">🏺</span>
                <div>
                    <h1 class="font-extrabold text-sm sm:text-lg tracking-wider text-amber-300">เปิดถอดรหัสรอยอักษรสุโขทัย</h1>
                    <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-amber-200/80">
                        <span id="hud-room" class="font-bold text-amber-400">🚪 ห้อง 1/5</span>
                        <span>•</span>
                        <span id="camera-status" class="text-yellow-400">🟡 AR: กำลังโหลด...</span>
                        <span id="hand-status" class="hidden sm:inline text-gray-400">✋ ไม่พบมือ</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 sm:space-x-6 text-xs sm:text-base mt-2 sm:mt-0">
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-1">
                    <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">⭐</span>
                    <span id="hud-score" class="font-extrabold text-white">0</span>
                </div>
                <div class="flex items-center space-x-1.5">
                    <span class="text-cyan-400 font-bold">✨ พลังปัญญา</span>
                    <div class="w-16 sm:w-24 bg-gray-700/80 h-3.5 rounded-full overflow-hidden p-0.5 border border-cyan-500/50">
                        <div id="wisdom-bar" class="bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 to-blue-500 h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 0%"></div>
                    </div>
                    <span id="hud-wisdom" class="text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-bold text-cyan-300">0/5</span>
                </div>
                <div id="hud-combo-box" class="hidden flex items-center space-x-1 bg-amber-500/20 px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-amber-500/40">
                    <span class="text-orange-400 font-bold">🔥</span>
                    <span id="hud-combo" class="font-bold text-orange-300 text-xs">x0</span>
                </div>
                <button id="btn-sound" class="p-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-800/80 border border-amber-500/30 text-amber-300 hover:text-white" aria-label="Toggle Sound">
                    🔊
                </button>
            </div>
        </header>

        <main id="ui-layer" class="relative z-20 flex-1 flex items-center justify-center p-4">

            <div id="screen-start" class="text-center glass-panel p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl max-w-lg w-full border border-amber-500/40 shadow-2xl stone-float">
                <div class="text-6xl sm:text-7xl mb-4">🏺</div>
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-200 via-amber-400 to-yellow-500 mb-2">
                    เปิดถอดรหัสรอยอักษรสุโขทัย
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-200/80 mb-6 tracking-wide">
                    AR Ancient Sukhothai Letter Adventure
                </p>
                <div class="bg-amber-950/40 border border-amber-500/20 rounded-xl p-3 sm:p-4 mb-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-100/90 text-left thai-serif">
                    📜 <strong class="text-amber-300 font-bold">ภารกิจนักโบราณคดีน้อย:</strong> สำรวจห้องลับโบราณสมัยสุโขทัย ใช้มือควบคุมพลังเวทผ่านกล้อง (หรือเมาส์/สัมผัส) ถอดรหัสลายสือไทยโบราณเพื่อเปิดประตูกลหินทั้ง 5 ด่าน!
                </div>
                <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center">
                    <button id="btn-start" class="glass-btn px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-base sm:text-lg flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
                        <span>▶ เริ่มการผจญภัย</span>
                    </button>
                    <button id="btn-tutorial" class="bg-slate-800/90 hover:bg-slate-700/90 border border-amber-500/40 px-5 py-3 rounded-xl font-semibold text-sm sm:text-base flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
                        <span>❔ วิธีการเล่น</span>
                    </button>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-4 text-[10px] text-amber-400/60">* รองรับกล้อง Webcam ท่าทางมือ หรือคลิกด้วยเมาส์/ทัชสกรีน</p>
            </div>

            <div id="screen-tutorial" class="hidden glass-panel p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl max-w-xl w-full border border-amber-500/40 shadow-2xl">
                <h2 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-amber-300 text-center mb-6">📜 วิธีการสำรวจและควบคุม</h2>
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-6 text-xs sm:text-sm">
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/60 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-3xl">☝️</span>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold text-amber-300">ชี้นิ้วชี้ (Cursor)</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-[11px]">เลื่อนตำแหน่งเป้าหมายสำรวจบนจอ</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/60 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-3xl">🤏</span>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold text-amber-300">จีบนิ้วชี้กับโป้ง (Pinch)</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-[11px]">คลิกเลือกแผ่นป้าย / ยืนยันคำตอบ</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/60 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-3xl">✋</span>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold text-amber-300">แบมือ (Open Palm)</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-[11px]">ปิดหน้าต่าง / ถอยกลับ</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-slate-800/60 p-3.5 rounded-xl border border-amber-500/20 flex items-center space-x-3">
                        <span class="text-3xl">✌️</span>
                        <div>
                            <p class="font-bold text-amber-300">ชูสองนิ้ว (Two Fingers)</p>
                            <p class="text-slate-300 text-[11px]">ขอคำใบ้พิเศษ (-3 คะแนน)</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="bg-blue-950/40 p-3 rounded-lg border border-blue-500/30 text-center text-xs text-blue-200 mb-6">
                    💡 <strong>คำแนะนำ:</strong> หากไม่มีกล้องหรือระบบมือไม่พร้อม สามารถใช้ <strong>เมาส์คลิก หรือแตะสัมผัสหน้าจอ</strong> เล่นได้ 100%
                </div>
                <div class="flex justify-end space-x-3">
                    <button id="btn-tut-close" class="glass-btn px-6 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm">เข้าใจแล้ว เริ่มเลย ▶</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="modal-question" class="hidden glass-panel p-5 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full border border-amber-500/50 shadow-2xl relative">
                <div class="flex justify-between items-center mb-3">
                    <span class="text-xs font-bold text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center gap-1">
                        <span>🔍</span> ถอดรหัสลายสือไทย
                    </span>
                    <button id="btn-modal-hint" class="text-xs bg-amber-900/60 hover:bg-amber-800 text-amber-300 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-amber-500/40 flex items-center gap-1">
                        <span>💡 ขอคำใบ้ (-3)</span>
                    </button>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-gradient-to-b from-stone-900 via-stone-800 to-stone-900 border-2 border-amber-500/40 rounded-xl p-4 text-center my-3 shadow-inner relative overflow-hidden">
                    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-amber-500/5 backdrop-blur-[1px]"></div>
                    <div class="relative z-10">
                        <div id="ancient-letter-container" class="h-28 flex items-center justify-center text-amber-400">
                            </div>
                        <p class="text-[11px] text-amber-300/80 mt-1 font-semibold tracking-wider">ลายสือไทยสมัยสุโขทัย</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-center text-slate-200 mb-3 thai-serif font-medium">
                    ตรงกับ <strong class="text-amber-300">อักษรไทยปัจจุบัน</strong> ตัวใด?
                </p>

                <div id="choice-container" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 sm:gap-3 mb-3">
                    </div>

                <div id="feedback-panel" class="hidden mt-3 p-3 rounded-xl border text-xs thai-serif">
                    <div id="feedback-title" class="font-bold mb-1 flex items-center gap-1.5"></div>
                    <div id="feedback-fact" class="text-slate-300 text-[11px]"></div>
                </div>

                <div class="mt-4 flex justify-end">
                    <button id="btn-modal-close" class="hidden glass-btn px-5 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs font-bold">ต่อไป ▶</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="banner-room-intro" class="hidden text-center glass-panel px-8 py-6 rounded-2xl max-w-sm border border-amber-500/50 shadow-2xl animate-bounce">
                <span class="text-4xl mb-2 block">🚪✨</span>
                <h3 id="room-intro-title" class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-amber-300 mb-1">ห้องลับแห่งที่ 1</h3>
                <p id="room-intro-desc" class="text-xs text-amber-100/90 thai-serif">จงถอดรหัสรอยอักษร 5 แผ่น เพื่อเปิดประตูกลหินโบราณ</p>
            </div>

            <div id="screen-room-complete" class="hidden text-center glass-panel p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-2xl max-w-md w-full border border-amber-500/40 shadow-2xl">
                <span class="text-5xl mb-2 block">🎉</span>
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-extrabold text-amber-300 mb-1">ปลดล็อกประตูกลสำเร็จ!</h2>
                <p class="text-xs text-amber-200/80 mb-4">คุณผ่านการทดสอบถอดรหัสประจำห้อง</p>
                <div class="bg-stone-900/70 rounded-xl p-4 border border-amber-500/20 mb-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-left space-y-2">
                    <div class="flex justify-between"><span>⭐ คะแนนสะสม:</span><strong id="rc-score" class="text-amber-300">0</strong></div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between"><span>✨ พลังแห่งปัญญา:</span><strong id="rc-wisdom" class="text-cyan-300">5/5</strong></div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between"><span>🔥 Combo สูงสุด:</span><strong id="rc-combo" class="text-orange-300">0</strong></div>
                </div>
                <button id="btn-next-room" class="glass-btn w-full py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-base">เข้าสู่ห้องถัดไป 🚪▶</button>
            </div>

            <div id="screen-final" class="hidden text-center glass-panel p-6 sm:p-10 rounded-2xl max-w-lg w-full border-2 border-yellow-400 shadow-2xl stone-float">
                <span class="text-6xl mb-3 block">🏆</span>
                <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-200 via-amber-400 to-yellow-500 mb-1">
                    ภารกิจสำเร็จ!
                </h2>
                <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-amber-200 mb-4 thai-serif">
                    นักโบราณคดีน้อยได้กอบกู้มรดกแห่งอักษรไทยสุโขทัยสำเร็จอย่างสมบูรณ์
                </p>

                <div id="final-stars" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl mb-4 text-amber-400 flex justify-center gap-2">
                    <span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span><span>⭐</span>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-stone-900/80 rounded-xl p-4 border border-amber-500/30 mb-6 text-xs sm:text-sm text-left space-y-2.5">
                    <div class="flex justify-between"><span>⭐ คะแนนทั้งหมด:</span><strong id="final-score" class="text-amber-300 text-lg">0</strong></div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between"><span>✅ ถอดรหัสถูกต้อง:</span><strong class="text-green-400">25 / 25 แผ่นป้าย</strong></div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between"><span>✨ พลังปัญญาที่สะสม:</span><strong class="text-cyan-400">25 / 25 หน่วย</strong></div>
                    <div class="flex justify-between"><span>🏅 ฉายานักโบราณคดี:</span><strong id="final-rank" class="text-yellow-300">ปรมาจารย์ศิลาจารึก</strong></div>
                </div>

                <button id="btn-restart" class="glass-btn w-full py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-base flex items-center justify-center space-x-2">
                    <span>🔄 เล่นใหม่อีกครั้ง</span>
                </button>
            </div>

        </main>

        <footer class="relative z-10 w-full px-4 py-2 text-center text-[10px] sm:text-xs text-amber-300/70 bg-stone-950/60 border-t border-amber-500/20">
            <span>💡 ใช้มือจีบนิ้ว 🤏 หรือคลิก/สัมผัสเพื่อโต้ตอบ | เปิดถอดรหัสลายสือไทยเพื่อรวบรวมพลังปัญญาให้ครบ 5/5</span>
        </footer>
    </div>

    <script>
        /* ==========================================================================
           1. CONSTANTS & GAME DATA
           ========================================================================== */
        const GAME_STATES = {
            START: "start",
            TUTORIAL: "tutorial",
            ROOM_INTRO: "roomIntro",
            PLAYING: "playing",
            CHOOSING: "choosing",
            DOOR_UNLOCK: "doorUnlock",
            ROOM_COMPLETE: "roomComplete",
            FINAL_TREASURE: "finalTreasure"
        };

        // 25 Questions distributed across 5 Rooms (5 Questions / Room)
        // SVG Paths provide accurate vector representations of ancient Sukhothai characters
